  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/melihercan/Me.Toolkit.Maui",
  "published": "2026-09-26T12:55:20.61Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "26.9.27 stamps the net10.0 assembly with the package version. 26.9.26 shipped it as 1.0.0.0 - the publish workflow's test step rebuilt that slice without the version before packing - while the Android, iOS, Mac Catalyst and Windows assemblies were right. Nothing else changed.\nFirst release, 26.9.26.\n{me:Relative} and SetRelativeSize size a double property as a percentage of the parent (less its padding), the window, the main display, an element named with x:Reference, or the nearest ancestor of a type. Width, Height, Shorter and Longer pick the dimension; Min and Max clamp the result; Portrait and Landscape give a different percentage for each orientation of the window. To=Self keeps an aspect ratio, Offset gives calc(50% - 8), and RelativeSizing's attached properties let a Style carry a relative size. The value is recomputed whenever the reference changes size or the element moves in the tree.",
